              "end": 7,
              "start": 7
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Thomas asked whether the City\u2019s designation of the flagpole as a limited or designated public forum was essential for the petitioners\u2019 success."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ecf79e111aaf5fa85d7a9214b5f8c925fe9a872e3e9434661c76262b42f8b6b0",
