              "end": 11,
              "start": 11
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kavanaugh, justice Kavanaugh questioned whether the City could allow patriotic flags but not those deemed anti\u2011American, such as an al\u202fQaeda flag."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ecf79e111aaf5fa85d7a9214b5f8c925fe9a872e3e9434661c76262b42f8b6b0",
