            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 30,
              "start": 30
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kagan asked whether the lack of city control meant the forum was not government speech."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ecf79e111aaf5fa85d7a9214b5f8c925fe9a872e3e9434661c76262b42f8b6b0",
            "evidence_ids": [
