            "pages": {
              "end": 45,
              "start": 45
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, justice Sotomayor inquired whether the nature of the forum was relevant to the case."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Barrett",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ecf79e111aaf5fa85d7a9214b5f8c925fe9a872e3e9434661c76262b42f8b6b0",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-ecf79e111aaf-0003-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 69,
              "start": 69
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Barrett asked whether a loss would cause the City to restructure its program to regain control over religious flags."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ecf79e111aaf5fa85d7a9214b5f8c925fe9a872e3e9434661c76262b42f8b6b0",
