              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to City of Boston, the City argues that its flag\u2011raising forum is not government speech under Walker and Summum; it is a public forum open to all applicants."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "City of Boston",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "ecf79e111aaf5fa85d7a9214b5f8c925fe9a872e3e9434661c76262b42f8b6b0",
